From be2c0089f1565fb77c2179717ac75ae2ad0abacb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:45:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] block-break-start: a mod's item may take a block break over
 (the Meka-Tool's vein mining and blasting)

registration.block-break; asked where ServerPlayerGameMode.destroyBlock starts (native_destroy_block), once the game allowed the break, for the PC and Android digs alike; true cancels the normal break and the mod breaks what it wants with world.break-blocks. Only the mod that owns the held item is asked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
